{"availability":"available","full":"redai-studio/Relax","name":"Relax","description":"An Asynchronous Reinforcement Learning Engine for Omni-Modal Post-Training at Scale","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":648,"forks":180,"created":"2026-04-13T02:39:35Z","updated":"2026-10-18T10:30:59Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://redai-studio.github.io/Relax","topics":["agentic-rl","distributed-training","grpo","multi-agent","multimodal","post-training","ray-serve","reinforcement-learning","rlhf"],"demo":"https://redai-studio.github.io/Relax","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:29:04.687Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:29:04.687Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:29:04.687Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:53:52.390Z","stars":637,"forks":175},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:09.083Z","stars":641,"forks":176},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:27:00.122Z","stars":641,"forks":177},{"at":"2026-10-18T11:29:04.687Z","stars":648,"forks":180}],"technologies":["Vue","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Towards Async, Omni-Modal RL at Scale, Just Relax.","Relax (Reinforcement Engine Leveraging Agentic X-modality) is a high-performance reinforcement learning post-training framework open-sourced by the Xiaohongshu AI Infra Team for multimodal large language models. Built on Ray Serve with a service-oriented architecture, Relax uses Megatron-LM as the training backend and SGLang as the inference engine. Through the TransferQueue data transfer system, it achieves complete decoupling of training and inference, supporting end-to-end multimodal RL training from text to images, videos, and audio."],"features":["🌐 Full Omni-Modal Training — One unified framework for text, vision, and audio RL — one of the few systems capable of end-to-end Omni model (Qwen3-Omni) post-training","⚙️ Service-Oriented Six-Layer Architecture — Every role is an independent Ray Serve deployment, with native service-level elastic scheduling and fault recovery","⚡ Fully Async via TransferQueue — Rollout, Actor, ActorFwd, Reference, and Advantages run on independent GPU clusters with streaming data exchange and configurable staleness","🔁 Hybrid Mode — Separate Actor/Rollout placement groups with TransferQueue streaming, while ref / actorfwd / advantages run in-process on the actor — pairs --balance-data with sub-batched forward to minimize GPU waste","🤖 Agentic RL — Multi-turn interaction, loss masking, flexible termination, and VLM multimodal context carry-over for closed-loop \"execute → observe → decide\" training"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/redai-studio/Relax/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c1954f2a5798bba379456047de5f6c2da8901c32f1400bc8b60db09edf772f64","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:52.509Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:09.203Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Towards Async, Omni-Modal RL at Scale, Just Relax.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/redai-studio/Relax/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c1954f2a5798bba379456047de5f6c2da8901c32f1400bc8b60db09edf772f64","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/redai-studio/Relax/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:09.203Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T18:37:17Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/redai-studio/Relax/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T05:04:07.337Z","hash":"2ac69acc279b07c1701c2d1c08952e4858bd608c0a7db0bb8ce6ff61ba844044","originalBytes":25459,"storedBytes":25459,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:09.083Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Education","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Health & fitness","Streaming","MCP servers & agents","Image, audio & video AI","Maths & algorithms","Writing & documents"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoH